      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Every gene of a cell by gene matrix is tested between two groups of cells (a Wilcoxon rank-sum per gene) and drawn as a volcano with the ranked markers below; the tab opens on cluster_1 against cluster_2, whose planted markers gene_01 to gene_04 stand out. Change Group A or Group B in the tile header, or box-select cells on the scatter, save them as a group from the Analysis panel and pick that group instead. Inputs are per-cell matrices from nf-core/scrnaseq once clustered, or per-sample tables grouped by condition such as nf-core/rnaseq normalised counts.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/advanced_viz_demo"
    },
